  abilityDesc: Massive Dark attack on all foes (damage relative to remaining HP),
    enormously boosts Atk, Def, Rec for 4 turns, enormously boosts Spark damage for
    4 turns, enormously boosts own Spark damage for 4 turns, Spark damage boosts
    BB gauge for 4 turns & adds evasion for 3 turns
